&lt;h3&gt;


Architecture-Specific: AI Architectures
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For architecture and real estate platforms, &lt;a href="https://ai-architectures.com" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;AI Architectures&lt;/a&gt; offers:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Sketch-to-render&lt;/strong&gt; - Convert architectural sketches to photorealistic renders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Floor plan generation&lt;/strong&gt; - Generate labeled floor plans from descriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
