&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Integration Approach
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


For Small-Scale Integration
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start with the Pro plan ($79/month, 200 generations)&lt;/li&gt;
