&lt;p&gt;Each component has its own atoms/molecules, as explained&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend - Landing page, Blog, Newsletter, Contact, Features, App, Privacy and, and Pricing and Legal pages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend - Authentication, Invoicing, Payments, Customers and other CRUD APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Admin Panel - Analytics, Invoicing, Payments, Customers, all in one advanced admin panel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Once that is completed in a boilerplate, we can easily build any application on top of it and manage, run and easily scale the application.&lt;/p&gt;

